\ designs/portable-knee/genes.4 - portable-knee's genes for forth/cross-cv8.4, written by lab/evolve/export-genes.py from the
\ options the evolver hands the translator (tools/layout.py) and the engine's flags. Include it before
\ cross-cv8.4: S" extend.4" INCLUDED  S" genes.4" INCLUDED  S" cross-cv8.4" INCLUDED
\ A list is a word giving its text ( --- c-addr u ), names and numbers each followed by one space.
VARIABLE G-AT
: G-LIST: ( "name" --- ) CREATE HERE G-AT ! 0 , DOES> DUP CELL+ SWAP @ ;
: G+ ( c-addr u --- ) DUP G-AT @ +! HERE SWAP DUP ALLOT CMOVE ;
8 CONSTANT G-CELL          \ the target's cell, bytes
G-LIST: G-OVERLAYS  \ after kernel.4, in this order
S" cv8.4 cv8b.4 cv8b-kfast.4 cv8b-kinput.4 cv8b-klookup.4 cv8-fuse.4 cv8-fuse-imm.4 cv8-fuse-loopall.4 " G+
S" cv8-fuse-iplus.4 file-sysc.4 file-sysc2.4 " G+
G-LIST: G-FOLDS  \ the fold set: FOLD-BASE + place
S" ! RSHIFT C@ C! AND OR XOR LIT U< OVER DROP SWAP >R R@ NEGATE < " G+
31 CONSTANT G-SPEC          \ the specialisations: 1 small, 2 imm, 4 var, 8 tiny, 16 loc
G-LIST: G-SUPERS  \ fused pairs: first second opcode
S" OVER C@ 53 + @ 54 @ + 55 " G+
G-LIST: G-OPS10  \ format-10 operations: name opcode
S" SWAP+I 126 I+ 127 (FIND) 89 (>NUMBER) 90 SCAN 91 SKIP 92 FILL 93 (PARSE) 94 HASH 95 PLACE 36 " G+
S" (LEAVE) 37 I 38 J 39 (DO) 40 (LOOP) 41 (+LOOP) 42 (?DO) 43 UNLOOP 44 ?BRANCH8 45 2@ 46 2! 47 " G+
S" BRANCH8 48 OVER?BRANCH 49 CMOVE 50 > 51 0= 52 " G+
0 CONSTANT G-HOTCALLS      \ one-byte calls, at most
-1 CONSTANT G-OP-BODIES     \ the format-10 words' bodies their opcode
-1 CONSTANT G-OP-INLINE     \ ...placed among the primitives
-1 CONSTANT G-BSS           \ TIB, POCKET, INCLUDE-BUFFER past the image's end
-1 CONSTANT G-THIN-HEADER   \ one empty thread head in the file
32 CONSTANT G-THREADS       \ the dictionary's hash threads
-1 CONSTANT G-RTFUSE        \ the run-time fuser's tables filled (cv8-fuse.4's SUPER-TABLE, IMM-OPS)
-1 CONSTANT G-ESCAPE         \ escaped primitives: two bytes, ESC and a selector
G-LIST: G-ESC-PRIMS  \ the escaped primitives
S" BYE OPEN-FILE CLOSE-FILE READ-LINE WRITE-LINE READ-FILE WRITE-FILE (SYSTEM) REPOSITION-FILE " G+
S" FILE-POSITION DELETE-FILE FILE-SIZE SYSCALL (EXECVE) (WAITPID) (PIPE) (DUP2) (GETENV) (SETENV) " G+
S" (SYS-EXIT) (CHDIR) (GETCWD) (SYS-ARGC) (SYS-ARG) (GETPID) (UNSETENV) ALLOCATE FREE RESIZE " G+
S" (GETPWHOME) (GETFSIZE) (SETFSIZE) " G+
0 CONSTANT G-VARSLOT        \ slot operands 2 or 3 bytes, high byte first; else 2, low first
G-LIST: G-REBIND  \ the kernel's uses rebound to the overlays' words
S" OPEN-FILE CLOSE-FILE WRITE-FILE ALLOCATE FREE " G+
G-LIST: G-HEADERLESS  \ no headers
S" FS-BLK FS0 FS1 FS2 FS3 FS4 FS-DROP FS-WRITE FS-NL FS-MMAP FS-OFL FS-END FS-SAVED " G+
1 CONSTANT G-ENGINE-SPEC   \ the engine's flags: SPEC (the locals block in the header)
29 CONSTANT G-FEATURES      \ the image's feature bits (engine/vm-lab.c's IMAGE_MAGIC)
76 CONSTANT G-MAGIC5
G-LIST: G-NOT-YET  \ the translator's options the cross compiler does not do yet
